                "schemeImageUrl": "",
                "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme “Maitri Prashikshan Karyakram” is implemented by the Uttarakhand Livestock Development Board (ULDB) under the Department of Animal Husbandry, Government of Uttarakhand. The scheme aims to enhance livestock productivity and improve  artificial insemination services across the state through the training and capacity building of local youth.\n<br>\n\n",
                "benefits_md": "\n- **In Hilly Districts:** ₹100/- per artificial insemination, with a minimum target of 25 to 30 inseminations.- **In Plain Districts:** ₹100/- per artificial insemination, with a minimum target of 50 to 60 inseminations.\n<br>\n\n",
